{"title":"硬件PCB设计及编程实现学习项目pixl.js-模拟Amiibo","slug":"硬件PCB设计及编程实现学习项目pixl-js-模拟Amiibo","date":"2026-06-08T04:01:42.000Z","updated":"2026-07-06T08:33:04.322Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/硬件PCB设计及编程实现学习项目pixl-js-模拟Amiibo.json","excerpt":" [Figure] 学习中…. 等待进一步更新","covers":["https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/06/image-20260608120440379.png","https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/06/image-20260608120850661.png","https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/06/image-20260629182317946.png","https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260702115718816.png","https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/48041782966211_.pic.jpg","https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260702160639126.png","https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260706160335351.png","https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260706163219671.png","https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/06/image-20260629180155329.png"],"content":"<img class=\"lozad\" data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/06/image-20260608120440379.png\">\n\n<p>An emulator for Amiibo! <a href=\"https://github.com/solosky/pixl.js/\">开源项目地址</a>: 这是一个基于原版<a href=\"http://www.espruino.com/Pixl.js\">Pixl.js</a>的复刻版本，主要的功能是用来模拟Amiibo。<br>学习中…. 等待进一步更新</p>\n<span id=\"more\"></span>\n\n<div> \n<button onclick=\"synthesizeSpeech()\">朗读全文</button>\n</div>\n<audio controls id=\"audioPlayer\">Your browser does not support the audio element.</audio>      \n<script>\n  function synthesizeSpeech() { \n    var inputText = document.getElementsByClassName('post-block')[0].innerText;\n    var voice = \"ZH\";\n    var url = 'https://tts.carlzeng.com:3/speech?text=' + encodeURIComponent(inputText.substring(0,3000)) + '&voice=' + voice;\n    var audioPlayer = document.getElementById('audioPlayer');          \n    audioPlayer.src = url;\n    audioPlayer.load();\n    audioPlayer.play();\n  }\n</script>\n\n\n<h1 id=\"有什么用\"><a href=\"#有什么用\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"有什么用\"></a>有什么用</h1><p>学习PCB设计</p>\n<p>主板图纸和走线</p>\n<p>芯片针脚定义</p>\n<p>功能设计</p>\n<p>软件刷写, 固件刷写</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/06/image-20260608120850661.png\" alt=\"image-20260608120850661\"></p>\n<h1 id=\"相关内容\"><a href=\"#相关内容\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"相关内容\"></a>相关内容</h1><iframe style=\"box-shadow: 0px 0px 20px -10px;\" src=\"https://query.carlzeng.com/appsearch?q=switch\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"auto\" width=\"100%\" height=\"500\"></iframe>\n\n<h1 id=\"实现方法\"><a href=\"#实现方法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"实现方法\"></a>实现方法</h1><p>学习中…. 等待进一步更新</p>\n<h2 id=\"关于充电\"><a href=\"#关于充电\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"关于充电\"></a>关于充电</h2><p>插上老C口, 就是这个正极, 电脑usb 5V, 直接给这个正极供电, 给3.3V的纽扣电池充电?</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/06/image-20260629182317946.png\" alt=\"image-20260629182317946\"></p>\n<p>这是几层的PCB板子? 三层?</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260702115718816.png\" alt=\"image-20260702115718816\"></p>\n<p>主控芯片是那颗? 在那里?</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/48041782966211_.pic.jpg\" alt=\"48041782966211_.pic\"></p>\n<p>为何只有一颗NRF52832 这颗无限射频收发器芯片, 就够上传下载固件, 把数据库放到存储芯片里面 等等….</p>\n<p>详见<a href=\"https://static.szlcsc.com/ecp/assets/app/generic/web/viewer.html?file=https://atta.szlcsc.com/upload/public/pdf/source/20191122/C77540_B22384C9419DF4416C7889F27174782C.pdf#page=1&view=fitH\">nRF52832芯片定义</a>:</p>\n<iframe style=\"box-shadow: 0px 0px 20px -10px;\" src=\"https://static.szlcsc.com/ecp/assets/app/generic/web/viewer.html?file=https://atta.szlcsc.com/upload/public/pdf/source/20191122/C77540_B22384C9419DF4416C7889F27174782C.pdf#page=1&view=fitH\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"auto\" width=\"100%\" height=\"500\"></iframe>\n\n<p>看这颗芯片, 又有疑问: </p>\n<p>电源是如何进入的呢? 第一个针脚是电压&#x2F;供电针脚, 可是它连了一个电容然后接地了, 没有供电呀?</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260702160639126.png\" alt=\"image-20260702160639126\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"原理图\"><a href=\"#原理图\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"原理图\"></a>原理图</h2><p>OLED版本: <a href=\"https://gitlab.com/xiaohai/pixl.js\">https://gitlab.com/xiaohai/pixl.js</a></p>\n<p>原理图可以很清晰的看到针脚定义, 以及在设计层面这个针脚本该有的 (比如: 阻值, 电压…)</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260706160335351.png\" alt=\"image-20260706160335351\"></p>\n<p>用料对应图:</p>\n<p>这个html文件, 直接点取右侧图片, 可以现实左侧的用量和型号 数值</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260706163219671.png\" alt=\"image-20260706163219671\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"Joycon2手柄的电源IC-BQ25618\"><a href=\"#Joycon2手柄的电源IC-BQ25618\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Joycon2手柄的电源IC: BQ25618\"></a>Joycon2手柄的电源IC: BQ25618</h2><p>目前还买不到;<br>6月29日: 终于买到了2块, 试一试换上, 看看 上方的两个电容是否还继续短路?</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/06/image-20260629180155329.png\" alt=\"image-20260629180155329\"></p>\n<p>20260705 更换了全新的bq25618, 上方的两个大电容 依旧短路.</p>\n<p>下一步: 从短路的大电容 右侧(非接地脚), 接正极, 烧机.</p>\n<h2 id=\"应用-joycon-NFC-Error-3MCUONBUSY\"><a href=\"#应用-joycon-NFC-Error-3MCUONBUSY\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"应用 joycon NFC Error 3MCUONBUSY!\"></a>应用 joycon NFC Error 3MCUONBUSY!</h2><p>When using IR Camera or NFC with Joycon of FW Version 3.89, it is said to be <em>Error 3MCUONBUSY</em> !</p>\n<p>我的情况是使用NFC with Joycon, 报错:  <em>Error 3MCUONBUSY</em> !</p>\n<p>Can you run the jctool exe with the <strong>-d</strong> command line option? It will create a traffic log which will help find out what’s happening.</p>\n<p>下一步: 导出蓝牙通信日志</p>\n<h1 id=\"灵感来源\"><a href=\"#灵感来源\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"灵感来源\"></a>灵感来源</h1><p><a href=\"https://github.com/solosky/pixl.js/\">https://github.com/solosky/pixl.js/</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://gbatemp.net/threads/tool-joy-con-toolkit.478560/page-45\">https://gbatemp.net/threads/tool-joy-con-toolkit.478560/page-45</a></p>\n","more":"<div> \n<button onclick=\"synthesizeSpeech()\">朗读全文</button>\n</div>\n<audio controls id=\"audioPlayer\">Your browser does not support the audio element.</audio>      \n<script>\n  function synthesizeSpeech() { \n    var inputText = document.getElementsByClassName('post-block')[0].innerText;\n    var voice = \"ZH\";\n    var url = 'https://tts.carlzeng.com:3/speech?text=' + encodeURIComponent(inputText.substring(0,3000)) + '&voice=' + voice;\n    var audioPlayer = document.getElementById('audioPlayer');          \n    audioPlayer.src = url;\n    audioPlayer.load();\n    audioPlayer.play();\n  }\n</script>\n\n\n<h1 id=\"有什么用\"><a href=\"#有什么用\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"有什么用\"></a>有什么用</h1><p>学习PCB设计</p>\n<p>主板图纸和走线</p>\n<p>芯片针脚定义</p>\n<p>功能设计</p>\n<p>软件刷写, 固件刷写</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/06/image-20260608120850661.png\" alt=\"image-20260608120850661\"></p>\n<h1 id=\"相关内容\"><a href=\"#相关内容\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"相关内容\"></a>相关内容</h1><iframe style=\"box-shadow: 0px 0px 20px -10px;\" src=\"https://query.carlzeng.com/appsearch?q=switch\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"auto\" width=\"100%\" height=\"500\"></iframe>\n\n<h1 id=\"实现方法\"><a href=\"#实现方法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"实现方法\"></a>实现方法</h1><p>学习中…. 等待进一步更新</p>\n<h2 id=\"关于充电\"><a href=\"#关于充电\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"关于充电\"></a>关于充电</h2><p>插上老C口, 就是这个正极, 电脑usb 5V, 直接给这个正极供电, 给3.3V的纽扣电池充电?</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/06/image-20260629182317946.png\" alt=\"image-20260629182317946\"></p>\n<p>这是几层的PCB板子? 三层?</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260702115718816.png\" alt=\"image-20260702115718816\"></p>\n<p>主控芯片是那颗? 在那里?</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/48041782966211_.pic.jpg\" alt=\"48041782966211_.pic\"></p>\n<p>为何只有一颗NRF52832 这颗无限射频收发器芯片, 就够上传下载固件, 把数据库放到存储芯片里面 等等….</p>\n<p>详见<a href=\"https://static.szlcsc.com/ecp/assets/app/generic/web/viewer.html?file=https://atta.szlcsc.com/upload/public/pdf/source/20191122/C77540_B22384C9419DF4416C7889F27174782C.pdf#page=1&view=fitH\">nRF52832芯片定义</a>:</p>\n<iframe style=\"box-shadow: 0px 0px 20px -10px;\" src=\"https://static.szlcsc.com/ecp/assets/app/generic/web/viewer.html?file=https://atta.szlcsc.com/upload/public/pdf/source/20191122/C77540_B22384C9419DF4416C7889F27174782C.pdf#page=1&view=fitH\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"auto\" width=\"100%\" height=\"500\"></iframe>\n\n<p>看这颗芯片, 又有疑问: </p>\n<p>电源是如何进入的呢? 第一个针脚是电压&#x2F;供电针脚, 可是它连了一个电容然后接地了, 没有供电呀?</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260702160639126.png\" alt=\"image-20260702160639126\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"原理图\"><a href=\"#原理图\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"原理图\"></a>原理图</h2><p>OLED版本: <a href=\"https://gitlab.com/xiaohai/pixl.js\">https://gitlab.com/xiaohai/pixl.js</a></p>\n<p>原理图可以很清晰的看到针脚定义, 以及在设计层面这个针脚本该有的 (比如: 阻值, 电压…)</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260706160335351.png\" alt=\"image-20260706160335351\"></p>\n<p>用料对应图:</p>\n<p>这个html文件, 直接点取右侧图片, 可以现实左侧的用量和型号 数值</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260706163219671.png\" alt=\"image-20260706163219671\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"Joycon2手柄的电源IC-BQ25618\"><a href=\"#Joycon2手柄的电源IC-BQ25618\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Joycon2手柄的电源IC: BQ25618\"></a>Joycon2手柄的电源IC: BQ25618</h2><p>目前还买不到;<br>6月29日: 终于买到了2块, 试一试换上, 看看 上方的两个电容是否还继续短路?</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/06/image-20260629180155329.png\" alt=\"image-20260629180155329\"></p>\n<p>20260705 更换了全新的bq25618, 上方的两个大电容 依旧短路.</p>\n<p>下一步: 从短路的大电容 右侧(非接地脚), 接正极, 烧机.</p>\n<h2 id=\"应用-joycon-NFC-Error-3MCUONBUSY\"><a href=\"#应用-joycon-NFC-Error-3MCUONBUSY\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"应用 joycon NFC Error 3MCUONBUSY!\"></a>应用 joycon NFC Error 3MCUONBUSY!</h2><p>When using IR Camera or NFC with Joycon of FW Version 3.89, it is said to be <em>Error 3MCUONBUSY</em> !</p>\n<p>我的情况是使用NFC with Joycon, 报错:  <em>Error 3MCUONBUSY</em> !</p>\n<p>Can you run the jctool exe with the <strong>-d</strong> command line option? It will create a traffic log which will help find out what’s happening.</p>\n<p>下一步: 导出蓝牙通信日志</p>\n<h1 id=\"灵感来源\"><a href=\"#灵感来源\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"灵感来源\"></a>灵感来源</h1><p><a href=\